# Extra Python drills, keyed by concept id. They are appended to each concept's quiz in learn.py.
# Aim: teach the exact Python idioms the 75 problems lean on, so the language never gets in the way.
# Questions with predict=True are checked at build time by running `code` and comparing stdout to the marked answer.

